in="37.208" end="43.991" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="37.208" end="37.383">Sil</span><span begin="37.383" end="37.767">ver</span> <span begin="37.767" end="39.073">sand</span> <span begin="40.904" end="41.649">un</span><span begin="41.649" end="42.279">der</span><span begin="42.279" end="43.991">neath</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">身下铺着银色的细沙</span></p><p begin="44.600" end="48.261" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="44.600" end="45.055">Talk</span> <span begin="45.055" end="45.467">to</span> <span begin="45.467" end="45.866">me</span> <span begin="45.866" end="46.452">as</span> <span begin="46.452" end="46.821">I</span> <span begin="46.821" end="47.230">am</span> <span begin="47.230" end="47.824">slee</span><span begin="47.824" end="48.261">ping</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">在我沉睡时对我低语</span></p><p begin="48.267" end="51.620" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="48.267" end="48.826">Hold</span> <span begin="48.826" end="49.118">me</span> <span begin="49.118" end="49.813">while</span> <span begin="49.813" end="50.139">I&apos;m</span> <span begin="50.139" end="50.573">drea</span><span begin="50.573" end="51.620">ming</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">在我梦境里拥抱着我</span></p><p begin="51.960" end="56.345" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="51.960" end="52.322">Ho</span><span begin="52.322" end="52.888">nest</span><span begin="52.888" end="53.399">ly,</span> <span begin="53.399" end="53.858">I</span> <span begin="53.858" end="54.313">could</span> <span begin="54.313" end="54.822">just</span> <span begin="54.822" end="55.144">breathe</span> <span begin="55.144" end="55.680">you</span> <span begin="55.680" end="56.345">in</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">说真的 我只想将你的气息吸入心底</span></p><p begin="59.283" end="1:02.919" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="59.283" end="59.783">Met</span> <span begin="59.783" end="1:00.296">you</span> <span begin="1:00.296" end="1:00.792">when</span> <span begin="1:00.792" end="1:01.245">my</span> <span begin="1:01.245" end="1:01.678">heart</span> <span begin="1:01.678" end="1:02.144">was</span> <span begin="1:02.144" end="1:02.511">blee</span><span begin="1:02.511" end="1:02.919">ding</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">遇见你时 我的心还在流血</span></p><p begin="1:03.001" end="1:06.136" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:03.001" end="1:03.348">I&apos;m</span> <span begin="1:03.348" end="1:03.920">cons</span><span begin="1:03.920" end="1:04.170">tant</span><span begin="1:04.170" end="1:04.898">ly</span> <span begin="1:04.898" end="1:05.304">fee</span><span begin="1:05.304" end="1:06.136">ling</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我始终沉溺于这种感觉</span></p><p begin="1:06.696" end="1:12.207" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:06.696" end="1:07.235">Drif</span><span begin="1:07.235" end="1:07.739">ting</span> <span begin="1:07.739" end="1:08.153">through</span> <span begin="1:08.153" end="1:08.619">an</span> <span begin="1:08.619" end="1:08.967">end</span><span begin="1:08.967" end="1:09.544">less</span> <span begin="1:09.544" end="1:10.032">re</span><span begin="1:10.032" end="1:10.456">ve</span><span begin="1:10.456" end="1:12.207">rie</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">在无尽的梦境里缓缓漂流</span></p><p begin="1:28.918" end="1:35.173" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:28.918" end="1:29.102">Twi</span><span begin="1:29.102" end="1:29.566">light</span> <span begin="1:29.566" end="1:30.886">moon,</span> <span begin="1:32.504" end="1:33.241">in</span><span begin="1:33.241" end="1:33.942">ter</span><span begin="1:33.942" end="1:35.173">lude</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">暮色中的月亮一段静谧的插曲</span></p><p begin="1:36.263" end="1:42.791" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:36.263" end="1:36.546">Fell</span> <span begin="1:36.546" end="1:36.902">in</span> <span begin="1:36.902" end="1:38.203">love</